Homeric
=======

This product includes software developed by Superlist GmbH and the super_editor
contributors. The packages under `packages/` are forks of the following
upstream packages, vendored from
https://github.com/superlistapp/super_editor at commit 068a20d3
(super_editor_clipboard v0.2.5, January 28 2026), then renamed by
`tools/rename.sh`:

  - packages/homeric/                  ← super_editor/        (0.3.0-dev.51)
  - packages/homeric_text_layout/      ← super_text_layout/   (0.1.18)
  - packages/homeric_attributed_text/  ← attributed_text/     (0.4.5)
  - packages/homeric_markdown/         ← super_editor_markdown/

All upstream code is MIT-licensed; see LICENSE.

The StepMap and DecorationSet APIs (to be added in Phase 3) are designs ported
from ProseMirror (https://prosemirror.net), MIT-licensed, © Marijn Haverbeke
and contributors. Implementation references:

  - prosemirror-transform: https://github.com/ProseMirror/prosemirror-transform
  - prosemirror-view (Decoration): https://github.com/ProseMirror/prosemirror-view
  - prosemirror-changeset: https://github.com/ProseMirror/prosemirror-changeset

When Homeric re-uses ProseMirror algorithms verbatim (e.g., the StepMap
position-mapping math), the file header will cite the specific upstream file
and commit.
